<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of beverages maker and distributor Peace Hill Enterprise Group Ltd was suspended Wesnesday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Peace Hill shares were last traded at HK$3.70, up HK$0.20 or 5.71 percent from Tuesday's close.</p>
<p>Volume was 216,000 shares worth HK$785,400.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
